{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-1f5c48ef336b503174f089153f68935e941b6bbc7f1b1615","family_id":"KR:000623","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법","kind":"법률","source_version":"276071","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=276071","source_sha256":"bcb73bb30b84092164a84d6f85dcf76e19bd67f4f4178be2e290e41bb600bb3b","body_sha256":"5554a3eade14b525642e315a3a8c3964562d7b70049cb4a2fc8523d1b3f2fe0c","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA <Act No. 11603, Jan. 1, 2013>\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date)\nThis Act shall enter into force on January 1, 2013.\nArticle 2 (Applicability to special cases on blend of different petroleum products in oil reservoirs)\nThe amended provisions of Article 8-3 shall begin to apply to the occurrence of blended oil, etc. after this Act enters into force.\nArticle 3 (Amendment of other Acts)\n(1) The Act to Repeal the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act (Act No. 9346) (including the provisions amended by the Act Partially Amending the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act (Act No. 9901)) is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 1 of the Addenda, \"January 1, 2013\" is replaced by \"January 1, 2016\".\n(2) The Act on Temporary Special Cases concerning the Customs Act and Other Acts pursuant to the Implementation of the Agreement under Article IV of the Mutual Defense Treaty between the Republic of Korea and the United States of America regarding Facilities and Areas and the Status of United States Armed Forces in the Republic of Korea (Act No. 9902) is partially amended as follows:\nIn the proviso to the Addenda, \"January 1, 2013\" is replaced by \"January 1, 2016\".\n(3) The Corporate Tax Act (Act No. 10423) is partially amended as follows:\nIn the proviso to Article 1 of the Addenda, \"January 1, 2013\" is replaced by \"January 1, 2016\".\n(4) The Act on the Special Accounts for Energy and Resources-Related Projects (Act No. 10594) is partially amended as follows:\nIn the proviso to the Addenda, \"January 1, 2013\" is replaced by \"January 1, 2016\".\n(5) The Act Wholly Amending the Framework Act on Environmental Policy (Act No. 10893) (including the provisions amended by the Act Partially Amending the Framework Act on Environmental Policy (Act No. 11268)) is partially amended as follows:\nIn the portion of Article 4-2 of the Addenda other than its subparagraphs, \"December 31, 2012\" is replaced by \"December 31, 2015\".\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\934d98418ed29247e09ab5e52b125244c3ff63c775206806d64ee3c15b36a039.ascii.json","sha256":"934d98418ed29247e09ab5e52b125244c3ff63c775206806d64ee3c15b36a039"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"1dbc6be64f0aa75e4c1816b4e27380accdd6b0dbb2a1e7a4e5701077bbe7173d","unit_key":"preamble-0"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"194218ffdb3cb55271f94475d41cab739a3b3747075854dfaf254f02f616f535","unit_key":"addenda-04667-19931231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"159d2d1f3f5af256bae83662a60a294c711b34bc2696174c40a313b189881bbd","unit_key":"addenda-04809-19941222"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"18c4cc374747f710b680504227e4095c8a1ada1e097c27fb159b64508a3ea90c","unit_key":"addenda-05494-19980108"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"a2a2df208d000e471914b7e68d54faf5d8e459c8322f1458a090efc3d6aae55e","unit_key":"addenda-06032-19991203"},{"source_component_text_sha256"